---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy | Aadit Agrawal"
	description="A plain-language account of the limited data used by aadit.cc."
>
	<article class="text-page">
		<header class="text-page__intro">
			<p class="text-page__eyebrow font-mono">privacy</p>
			<h1>A small site with a small data footprint.</h1>
			<p class="text-page__lede">
				This is a personal portfolio. It has no accounts, contact form, advertising,
				newsletter tracker, or first-party analytics. The page does not ask you for
				personal information.
			</p>
			<p class="text-page__updated font-mono">last updated: 23 august 2026</p>
		</header>

		<section aria-labelledby="browser-storage">
			<h2 id="browser-storage">Data kept in your browser</h2>
			<p>
				The theme switch stores your light or dark preference in local storage. The
				handwritten-name animation records in session storage whether it has already
				played during the current browser session. A service worker may cache public
				files so repeat visits load faster. This data stays in your browser, is not used
				to identify you, and can be removed through your browser's site-data controls.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="hosting">
			<h2 id="hosting">Hosting and routine request logs</h2>
			<p>
				Vercel hosts the public site. Like other web hosts, it may process routine
				request information needed to deliver and protect the service, such as an IP
				address, user agent, requested path, response status, and request time. I do not
				combine those logs with an advertising profile or sell information about site
				visitors.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="outside-links">
			<h2 id="outside-links">Email and outside links</h2>
			<p>
				If you email me, your message and address are handled by the mail services used
				to send and receive that conversation. Links to GitHub, LinkedIn, my blog, and
				other projects take you to services with their own privacy practices. Questions
				about this page can be sent to
				<a href="mailto:mail@aaditagrawal.com">mail@aaditagrawal.com</a>.
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.text-page {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-2xl);
		max-width: 58ch;
	}

	.text-page__intro {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-md);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.text-page__eyebrow {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
	}

	.text-page h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
		line-height: 1.08;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		max-width: 18ch;
	}

	.text-page__lede {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.text-page__updated {
		color: var(--text-disabled);
		font-size: 0.6875rem;
	}

	.text-page section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-sm);
	}

	.text-page h2 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.text-page section p {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}
</style>
